@kirin 2
@entry example_semantics "验收示例基础数学语义"
@status "example_only"

----
完全虚构的普通条目，用于证明量纲和通用值域不是内核特权。
----

dimension damage "伤害"

dimension time "时间"

unit damage = damage

unit time = time

unit damage_per_time = damage * time ** (-1)

domain probability: dimensionless in 0..1

domain positive_integer: dimensionless in 1..* integer
